msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Hold <Action:Battle_Fight_Stance@Combat> to enter a fighting stance and\r\n"
"press <Action:Battle_Drop_Weapon@Combat> just as the opponent throws a\r\n"
" punch to perform a <Color:7>Komaki Parry<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"After this, approach the unconscious opponent and\r\n"
"press <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> to perform <Color:7>Komaki Dragon King Essence<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "A Skill Showdown!"
msgstr ""
